OL,3,AAide to fugitive Ukrainian ex-PM
OL,4,Awounded in latest Moscow car bombing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car bomb attack in Moscow has wounded
OL,7,Fa former adviser to Ukrainian ex-prime
OL,8,Fminister Mykola Azarov, Russia's
OL,9,FInvestigative Committee says.
OL,11,FSergei Zavorotny, now a journalist and
OL,12,Fcommentator, was behind the wheel of
OL,13,Fhis black Toyota when the explosion
OL,14,Fhappened and Azarov told Russian TV his
OL,15,Fcondition in hospital was "rather
OL,16,Fcritical".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
