OL,3,AAide to fugitive Ukrainian ex-PM
OL,4,Awounded in latest Moscow car bombing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe car bomb went off a day after a
OL,7,FRussian colonel was killed in another
OL,8,Fexplosion in St Petersburg, and both
OL,9,Fblasts are seen as part of a series of
OL,10,Fattacks on military and prominent
OL,11,Ffigures linked to Russia's full-scale
OL,12,Finvasion of Ukraine.
OL,14,FZavorotny, 72, worked as a press aide
OL,15,Fto Mykola Azarov in Kyiv until 2014.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
